      "sc:description": "FRIENDS GUI is an open-source, Python-based tool designed to extract, decode, and visualize 24-hour puffing topography (PT) data collected from a passive vaping monitor (FRIENDS). It assists in evaluating Electronic Nicotine Delivery Systems (ENDS) use and informing regulatory decisions.",
